# Build context allowlist for tools/bench-image/Dockerfile (context = repository root).
# Everything is excluded except the trees the image copies; caches, venvs and local tool state
# never enter the context.
*
!tools/bench-image
!tools/demo_bench/pyproject.toml
!tools/demo_bench/src
**/.omc
**/.claude
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/.venv
